  "epoch_note": "Distinct visitors per epoch, counted by the epoch digest \u2014 a one-way HMAC over (Pacific month, network address, user-agent) under a per-site secret. Within an epoch a visitor is one digest across all its days, so returning_visitors (digests active on two or more distinct Pacific days in the epoch) is a measured count, not an estimate. Epoch counting begins Oct 19, 2026 (the deployment); the October 2026 epoch is partial. The user-agent string is inside the digest, so a visitor whose agent string changes mid-epoch counts as two \u2014 the documented residual of the digest design. Digest values are never published.",
