  "record_reads_note": "Record reads: the record measuring itself \u2014 reads of the public counts payload (counts-read) and the public ledger file (ledger-read), by the stewards' snapshot and dashboard and by any outside reader. They are part of the site's functioning, so since Oct 21, 2026 they are excluded from the by-class totals above and published here as each day's fold. The fold is zero before Oct 19, 2026: the gauges entered the record that day (before it, reads of them were not recorded at all).",
