  "visitor_note": "Distinct visitors per Pacific day, counted by visitor digest. The digest exists only on records written since Oct 18, 2026, so the series begins then and its first day is partial; earlier days are absent, never zero. The digest is a one-way HMAC over (Pacific date, network address, user-agent) under a per-site secret (Pacific-date keying since Oct 19, 2026; the first day's records were keyed on the UTC date, so Oct 18's figure straddles two keyings): it links a visitor's requests within a Pacific day and nothing across days, so each day's figure is that day's distinct count only \u2014 the days cannot be added into a total of distinct visitors. Digest values are never published. digest_bearing_requests is the day's requests that carried a digest at all; measured against requests_total (the day's requests from the same run's by-class series) it is the coverage of the distinct-visitor count \u2014 'distinct visitors' never silently reads as all traffic. Shared network egress understates the count; rotating egress overstates it."
}
